%   - Superior small caps design (less tracking needed)
%
% REFERENCES:
%   - GUST e-foundry (2009). TeX Gyre Pagella. GUST.
%   - Sharpe, M. (2021). newpx: Palatino-based math fonts. CTAN.
%   - Zapf, H. (1950). Original Palatino design principles.
% 
% ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

